    "24 ounce boneless, skinless chicken thighs (cubed)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all of the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54641-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Cauliflower-Chicken-1-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the chicken thighs into cubes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54641-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Cauliflower-Chicken-2-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place half of the cauliflower onto the bottom of a crock pot. Cube the cream cheese and add that into the pot.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54641-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Cauliflower-Chicken-3-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the cubed chicken thighs and another layer of the cauliflower and cubed cream cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54641-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Cauliflower-Chicken-4-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cheddar cheese and chopped bacon. Cook on low for 5 - 6 hours and stir about two times while cooking.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54641-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Cauliflower-Chicken-5-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garnish with green onions. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cauliflower-chicken/#wprm-recipe-54641-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
